			title: "Methalox"
			x: 28.0d
			y: -6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["56FFD4EF98A6C3B8"]
			description: ["Merrillite is a phosphate, and no electrolyzer will split it. The &6Extraction Cascade&r leaches it in hydrochloric acid and then pulls the rare earths apart with kerosene, one stage at a time. A 7x5x13 hall of mixer-settler stages in inert PTFE casing and tempered glass. Merrillite dust, hydrochloric acid and kerosene for the Martian feed. Samarium, neodymium and mixed rare-earth chlorides. Circuit 1 leaches, circuit 2 extracts, and circuit 28 makes the SEG cut that strips europium from the Nether line. Each fluid needs its own output hatch, or the whole cascade stops."]
			icon: "gtceu:extraction_cascade"
			id: "3FCCD81DE98DA9EF"
			rewards: [{ id: "5F47032EACBE0A7F", type: "xp", xp: 80 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "783A6711D48C304B", item: "gtceu:merrillite_dust", type: "item" }
				{ id: "7B8358196931945F", item: "gtceu:extraction_cascade", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Extraction Cascade"
			x: 20.0d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["791D4E94384E12AB"]
			description: [
				"Real &6EV Energy Hatches&r need two things you only get late: fine platinum wire for the &6Extreme Voltage Coil&r, and MPIC chips."
				"The chips come from a phosphorus boule that grows slowly in the blast furnace, so start one early. Dynamo hatches are built the same way."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:ev_energy_input_hatch"
			id: "147B753858CA98F8"
			rewards: [{ id: "1945B8580D9E3172", type: "xp", xp: 70 }]
