			x: 36.0d
			y: 12.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5769033B186E75D4"]
			description: ["The &6EV Large Miner&r digs a wide square of ore and pulls it all up in one go. Its controller, with an EV hull, titanium frames and IV circuits, and drill fluid. Ore at a rate no single drill reaches. Ore out by bus. Feed the drilling fluid from a tank."]
